  "summary": "<p>Today, the Trump Administration convened senior officials from governments around the world to launch an unprecedented global offensive against the transnational threat of Radical Left terrorism. Under the leadership of President Donald J. Trump, far-left extremism will be treated with the same seriousness and ferocity the world has long reserved for jihadist terrorism. This is [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/trump-administration-unleashes-global-campaign-to-crush-radical-left-terrorism/\">Trump Administration Unleashes Global Campaign to Crush Radical Left Terrorism</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
  "content": "<div class=\"alignfull has-wide-width wp-block-whitehouse-topper\">\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper__inner-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper__content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper__headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<nav class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation\" data-block-version=\"1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__search\">\n\t\t\t<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" action=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\" class=\"wp-block-search__button-inside wp-block-search__icon-button wp-block-search\"    ><label class=\"wp-block-search__label screen-reader-text\" for=\"wp-block-search__input-6\" >Search</label><div class=\"wp-block-search__inside-wrapper\" ><input inputmode=\"search\" class=\"wp-block-search__input\" id=\"wp-block-search__input-6\" placeholder=\"Search News\" value=\"\" type=\"search\" name=\"s\"  /><button aria-label=\"Search\" class=\"wp-block-search__button has-icon wp-element-button\" type=\"submit\" ><svg class=\"search-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<path d=\"M18.3929 18.306L13.8709 13.6029C15.0336 12.2207 15.6706 10.4817 15.6706 8.67124C15.6706 4.44139 12.2292 1 7.99937 1C3.76951 1 0.328125 4.44139 0.328125 8.67124C0.328125 12.9011 3.76951 16.3425 7.99937 16.3425C9.58732 16.3425 11.1006 15.8635 12.3943 14.9543L16.9507 19.6932C17.1412 19.8909 17.3973 20 17.6718 20C17.9316 20 18.1781 19.9009 18.3652 19.7208C18.7628 19.3383 18.7755 18.7039 18.3929 18.306ZM7.99937 3.00119C11.1259 3.00119 13.6694 5.54471 13.6694 8.67124C13.6694 11.7978 11.1259 14.3413 7.99937 14.3413C4.87284 14.3413 2.32932 11.7978 2.32932 8.67124C2.32932 5.54471 4.87284 3.00119 7.99937 3.00119Z\"></path>\n\t\t\t\t</svg></button></div></form>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__mobile\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper